                "content": "## Kiva Microfinance CDC & Pipeline Observability Dashboard\n\nThis operational dashboard provides real-time health monitoring, CDC synchronization tracking, and infrastructure performance metrics across the entire Kiva Microfinance Data Platform.\n\n#### Key Monitoring Scopes:\n- **Change Data Capture (CDC) Integrity**: Real-time cross-database row count reconciliation between **PostgreSQL (OLTP)** and **ClickHouse (OLAP)** via `cdc-monitor`.\n- **Infrastructure Performance**: Network throughput for **Redpanda (Kafka streaming)** and memory utilization tracking for **ClickHouse**.\n- **Connector & Service Status**: Live status tracking for Debezium Kafka Connect workers and Postgres Exporter scrape endpoints.*",
