            "description": "Displays a real-time health summary for all primary data platform microservices (PostgreSQL OLTP, Redpanda Event Stream, ClickHouse OLAP, and the CDC Reconciliation Engine). Combines CPU utilization, resident memory footprint, monitoring probe response latency, and overall operational status derived from live Prometheus scrape targets.",
